From 6b1736bb501d43c8dd1d286664fae2d78aaefce3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Akshat Srivastava <akshat.sanya@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 10:58:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Sprint 3: swarms before the Dungeon Master, mixed monsters,
 Wizard, level 2, player login

Swarms (task 2)
- New SwarmManager (kept out of Match): swarms enter one after another, the next one when the
  battlefield is cleared; after the last swarm the Dungeon Master enters as the level's boss.
  The heroes win only when the boss is defeated. Round-based boss arrival still works for old levels.
- State/UI: 'Swarm 1 of 2 - the Dungeon Master waits', then 'The Dungeon Master is on the battlefield!'

Mixed monsters (task 4)
- Levels have 'swarms'; each swarm mixes monster kinds with countPerHero and/or a fixed count
- New monsters with the existing artwork: Skeleton, Lich, Red Dragon (boss); Goblin uses its coloured art
- validate_data checks every level file and warns about missing level backgrounds

Wizard (task 3)
- Wizard hero in heroes.json (Wizard_Artwork.png, same deck as the Warrior), WIZARD class in GameData,
  'coming soon' lock removed, lobby uses the final artwork

Level 2 and background (task 6)
- Level 2 'The Dragon's Lair' (replaces the temporary copy of level 1): skeletons and a goblin, then a
  Lich with skeletons, then the Dungeon Master as the Red Dragon
- New original background assets/Level_2_Artwork.png in the style of level 1; levels have a 'background'
- Level 1 rewritten with two swarms

Login (task 5)
- Username + password accounts with a permanent unique player ID ('P-K7RM2Q9X')
- Passwords stored only as salted PBKDF2-SHA256 hashes (self-contained, checked against official
  test vectors); accounts.json written atomically and ignored by git
- Login required before create/join; names come from the account; 5 failed logins disconnect;
  one account cannot take two seats in a room; rejoin only for the seat's own account
- Client: username/password/new-account fields, automatic login on every (re)connect, IDs in the lobby

All new values are marked temporary (confirm with Irma).
Tests: swarm_tests, account_tests (new); net_tests updated (swarms, Wizard, login). 22/22 pass.
